Contributing to the Enterprise Components
-----------------------------------------
Pull requests that modify any of the Enterprise Components listed in
ENTERPRISE.md are accepted only from contributors who have signed a
Contributor License Agreement (CLA) with the ShadowAI Contributors,
separate from the DCO-based workflow used for the Apache-licensed
Core. A PR-level bot or CI check will indicate when a CLA signature
is required.

